### Configuración de Variables Globales
@hostname = localhost
@port = 3000
@baseUrl = http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}/api/users

### 1. Registrar un Nuevo Usuario (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Saavedra",
  "email": "juan3@example.com",
  "password": "miPasswordSeguro123"
}

###

### 2. Iniciar Sesión / Login (POST)
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan3@example.com",
  "password": "miPasswordSeguro123"
}

###
